<v James Braly>I am on my way to meet my brother-- or my half-brother, depending on how you look at it. The internet is a very, very strange thing.
<v James Braly>我正在去见我兄弟的路上——或者说同父异母的兄弟，取决于你怎么看。互联网真是一件非常非常奇怪的事情。

