<v Ira Glass>The half-brother, Jan, who is from Norway, recently learned the name of his father for the very first time, did an internet search, discovered James' family in the United States, and was coming to meet them. The guy on the train asked James, what proof do you have? You going to get a DNA test or something?
<v Ira Glass>这位来自挪威的同父异母兄弟 Jan 最近第一次得知了他父亲的名字，在网上搜索了一下，发现了 James 在美国的家人，正准备来见他们。火车上的那个人问 James，你有什么证据？你要去做 DNA 测试之类的吗？

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:08.710
<v James Braly>Uh, not unless he asks me for a lot of money.
<v James Braly>呃，除非他找我要一大笔钱。

