<v James Braly>I think that's him.
<v James Braly>我想那就是他。

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:28.870
<v Ira Glass>His half-brother's a 52-year-old man with a waxed handlebar mustache, hair thinned from chemo, and his dad's eyes. He is instantly recognizable, James says, as family.
