<v Hyder Akbar>Everything's busted in. The whole car went on fire. Do you see that hole right there?
<v Hyder Akbar>所有东西都碎了。整辆车都着火了。你看到那边的那个洞了吗？

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:09.670
<v Ira Glass>Yeah. So there's a huge hole in the driver's side in the front, on the hood.
<v Ira Glass>是的。驾驶座前面车盖上有一个巨大的洞。

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:19.250
<v Hyder Akbar>[INAUDIBLE] right now. Yeah, that's where the RPG went through. And you're looking at it in reverse right now, I think, because of the cam. But that's basically where I was sitting, right above it.
<v Hyder Akbar>[听不清] 现在。是的，那就是 RPG 穿过的地方。我想因为摄像头的关系，你现在看到的应该是反过来的。但基本上就是我坐的地方，在它正上方。

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:32.120
<v Hyder Akbar>And that's where the RPG came through. And that's where I missed the bump of the RPG. I mean, he was aiming straight at me. Like I said, when I saw that RPG come at me, I thought it was done. So--
<v Hyder Akbar>那就是 RPG 进来的地方。那就是我躲过 RPG 的地方。我是说，他是直接瞄准我的。就像我说的，当我看到 RPG 向我飞来时，我以为完了。所以——

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:41.800
<v Ira Glass>So the car is on fire. You guys are in the car. These guys are shooting just a couple of hundred meters behind you. And maybe have they stopped at that point?
<v Ira Glass>车着火了。你们还在车里。这些人还在离你们几百米远的地方射击。他们当时停下了吗？

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:54.120
<v Hyder Akbar>So at this point, it's quiet for a second. We're all kind of looking around. Right then, these two pickup trucks of ANA soldiers are driving by on the opposite side, going in their direction.
<v Hyder Akbar>此时，安静了一秒钟。我们都在四处张望。就在那时，两辆装满阿富汗国民军士兵的皮卡车从对面开过，正朝他们的方向走。

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:56.490
<v Ira Glass>This is the Afghan army. This is friendly to you--
<v Ira Glass>这是阿富汗军队。这队人对你们很友好——

00:17:56.490 --> 00:18:10.430
<v Hyder Akbar>The Afghan National Army, yeah. So we see the Afghan National Army, two pickup trucks, plenty of guys in there. So we're like, OK-- phew-- coast clear. The ANA's going to be able to take care of this. And we get kind of relieved for a second.
<v Hyder Akbar>阿富汗国民军，是的。我们看到阿富汗国民军，两辆皮卡车，里面有很多人。所以我们想，好吧——呼——危险解除了。阿富汗国民军应该能处理这件事。我们稍微松了一口气。

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:20.390
<v Hyder Akbar>We get out of the car, we just see the ANA drive off. They saw it. They saw our car on fire. They definitely heard the RPG his us, because that doesn't make low noise.
<v Hyder Akbar>我们下车，看到阿富汗国民军开车走了。他们看见了。他们看见我们的车着火了。他们肯定听到了 RPG 击中我们，因为那动静不小。

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:28.320
<v Hyder Akbar>They heard the gunfire. And they just drive off. They just drive off, and I'm like, OK. All right.
